### Generate Key
GRPC localhost:5000/api_key.ApiKeyService/GenerateKey

{
    "permissions": ["read"],
    "description": "Hello World"
}

> {%
    client.assert(response.status === 207)
    client.global.set('token', response.body.token)
%}

### Validate Key For Roles
GRPC localhost:5000/api_key.ApiKeyService/CheckKeyPermissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "{{ token }}",
  "requiredPermissions": ["fooo"]
}
